OL,12,G0306 Outlook
OL,13,     FManizha Bakhtari was posted to
OL,14,     FAustria as Afghan ambassador. When
OL,15,     Fthe Taliban seized power she
OL,16,     Frefused to budge and since 2021,
OL,17,     Fremains the country's only female
OL,18,     Fambassador.
